^{:go/end 501} (go/func addCPUSamples "addCPUSamples takes a batch whose first byte is an EvCPUSamples event\n(indicating that the batch contains only CPU samples) and adds each\nsample contained therein to the provided samples list.\n" [^{:tag (slice cpuSample)} samples ^batch b] :results [(slice cpuSample) error]
